# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source documents are NOT committed. They are large (726 MB) and two exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file limit. The repo commits *extracted data* plus a
# hash manifest so any figure can be re-verified against the original.
# See docs/PROVENANCE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
sources/
build/

# Never commit source formats directly
*.pdf
*.xlsx
# ...except the ONE generated export (stage 101). `git add -A` silently skips an
# ignored file, so without this negation the workbook was committed-but-absent: the
# README linked it, the tests passed against the local copy, and the URL 404'd.
!data/exports/MFAS_Data_Warehouse.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.zip

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
